  "title": "Earth Day milestone: Coty’s Net Zero Targets Validated by the Science Based Targets initiative",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – April 22, 2026 -- Coty Inc. (NYSE: COTY) (Paris: COTY), one of the world’s largest beauty companies, today announced that the Science Based Targets initiative (SBTi) has validated the company’s net zero commitment for FY2050 under the Net Zero Standard. This approval confirms that Coty’s near and long-term goals align with the latest climate science, supporting global efforts to limit warming to 1.5°C.",
